# Proxy Supabase pelo mesmo host (antes de TUDO que não seja API local)
# Sem isso, /auth/* cai no catch-all SPA e o cliente recebe HTML em vez de JSON.
/auth/*                 https://api.agendeifacil.com/auth/:splat                 200
/rest/*                 https://api.agendeifacil.com/rest/:splat                 200
/storage/*              https://api.agendeifacil.com/storage/:splat              200
/functions/*            https://api.agendeifacil.com/functions/:splat            200
/realtime/*             https://api.agendeifacil.com/realtime/:splat             200
/graphql/*              https://api.agendeifacil.com/graphql/:splat              200

